  demo snapshot on a 256^3 periodic grid (./DTFE --config demo/config_DTFE.cfg)
- gadget_reader_HDF5.cc: read velocities from 'Velocities' (Gadget-4)
  or 'Velocity' (EAGLE-like files)
- README: demo instructions and note about 'module purge' on clusters
- .gitignore: ignore demo output

